Phase 4: Access pfSense Web GUI
Step	Action
1	Open browser on Admin VM → Go to https://192.168.56.1
2	Login: admin / pfsense
3	Complete Setup Wizard: Set hostname, domain, DNS, timezone, new password
Phase 5: Install pfBlockerNG and Telegraf
In pfSense Web GUI:

Step	Action
1	Go to System → Package Manager → Available Packages
2	Search and install pfBlockerNG-devel
3	Search and install Telegraf
Phase 6: Configure pfBlockerNG (DNSBL)
In pfSense Web GUI:

Step	Action
1	Go to Firewall → pfBlockerNG → DNSBL
2	Set DNSBL Mode → Unbound python mode
3	Set DNSBL Virtual IP → 0.0.0.0
4	Scroll to DNSBL Custom → Add domains to block (e.g., youtube.com)
5	Click Save
6	Go to Update → Click Run
